WEBVTT

01:01.600 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>Mad World</b></i>

01:07.650 --> 01:14.070
<i>Osaka</i>

01:21.160 --> 01:24.790
<b>This string of disappearances
isn't letting up, is it?</b>

01:24.790 --> 01:26.040
<b>That's true.</b>

01:26.040 --> 01:28.790
<b>They've even increased in
the last few months.</b>

01:29.750 --> 01:33.710
<b>And we've had trouble identifying a lot
of the girls who went missing.</b>

01:35.010 --> 01:39.180
<b>So the police end up looking useless.</b>

01:49.150 --> 01:51.650
<b>Police vehicle, coming through!</b>

01:51.650 --> 01:53.400
<b>Make way, please!</b>

02:08.120 --> 02:09.130
<b>Sakomizu!</b>

02:09.130 --> 02:09.880
<b>You're late!</b>

02:10.460 --> 02:11.460
<b>Sorry, sir!</b>

02:12.040 --> 02:13.380
<b>Dammit.</b>

02:14.590 --> 02:15.920
<b>Sorry, sir!</b>

02:15.920 --> 02:18.510
<b>The captain always gets here first,
somehow.</b>

02:30.230 --> 02:31.610
<b>What's wrong, Mizu?</b>

02:32.310 --> 02:34.360
<b>Uh, it's nothing...</b>

02:40.070 --> 02:44.910
<b>All of the rooms were being used as housing
for women who had come to Japan to work.</b>

02:45.700 --> 02:48.580
<b>There've been at least
thirty women living here,</b>

02:48.580 --> 02:50.900
<b>but we won't be able to
get an exact number.</b>

03:13.270 --> 03:14.670
<b>Mizu!</b>

03:15.440 --> 03:18.570
<b>Did you find any leads?</b>

03:18.570 --> 03:19.670
<b>Not at all.</b>

03:20.570 --> 03:23.200
<b>We're not gonna get anything
else digging around here.</b>

03:24.410 --> 03:26.700
<b>Did you find anything, Ikeda?</b>

03:27.410 --> 03:34.750
<b>The people in the neighborhood didn't
notice any signs of a struggle, but...</b>

03:34.750 --> 03:36.460
<b>But what?</b>

03:36.460 --> 03:41.380
<b>Apparently there was a black male spotted,
wearing a long black coat, recently.</b>

03:46.850 --> 03:48.650
<b>The man in the black coat?</b>

03:49.230 --> 03:51.600
<b>Should we wrap up for today?</b>

03:51.600 --> 03:56.610
<b>I mean, didn't you say it was
your daughter's birthday?</b>

03:57.070 --> 03:57.820
<b>I'll handle the rest, so...</b>

03:57.820 --> 03:58.460
<b>No.</b>

03:59.960 --> 04:01.650
<b>Let's start asking
around about him.</b>

04:35.730 --> 04:36.770
<b>Shit!</b>

04:36.770 --> 04:39.280
<b>What the hell's going on?</b>

04:39.280 --> 04:42.400
<b>You mean to tell me that nobody noticed
such a conspicuous black guy?</b>

04:43.360 --> 04:47.990
<b><i>All active units, we've received reports of violence
at the Sakanishi Enterprises office.</i></b>

04:47.990 --> 04:50.740
<b><i>All units in the area, please respond.</i></b>

04:50.740 --> 04:51.390
<b>Dammit...</b>

04:52.150 --> 04:53.710
<b>and when we're busy too.</b>

04:55.580 --> 04:56.880
<b>This is car 3055, roger that.</b>

04:57.630 --> 04:59.040
<b>We'll head to the scene immediately.</b>

04:59.880 --> 05:00.800
<b>We will!?</b>

05:01.340 --> 05:04.800
<b>Every one of the disappearances has happened
around the Sakanishi office.</b>

05:05.300 --> 05:06.780
<b>There might be something there.</b>

05:13.640 --> 05:15.440
<b>Who the hell are you!?</b>

05:24.740 --> 05:28.450
<b>No matter where I go,
there's always people like this.</b>

05:28.450 --> 05:30.240
<b>Getting intel isn't exactly easy.</b>

05:32.410 --> 05:33.640
<b>I knew it.</b>

05:34.330 --> 05:37.420
<b>Who else are you working with?</b>

05:47.220 --> 05:48.340
<b>Ikeda, call an ambulance!</b>

05:48.340 --> 05:48.930
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

06:11.910 --> 06:13.450
<b>The man in the black coat!</b>

06:15.950 --> 06:16.580
<b>Freeze!</b>

06:16.580 --> 06:17.330
<b>Police!</b>

06:17.960 --> 06:19.960
<b>Take your weapon and
slowly place it on the floor!</b>

06:31.510 --> 06:32.100
<b>Mizu...</b>

06:35.020 --> 06:37.230
<b>The guy in the black coat!?</b>

06:40.480 --> 06:41.690
<b>Are you sure about that?</b>

06:44.020 --> 06:46.150
<b>Don't hit me, okay?</b>

06:46.150 --> 06:47.440
<b>Calm down.</b>

06:48.240 --> 06:49.860
<b>Even if you say that...!</b>

06:51.570 --> 06:53.530
<b>I-I'm gonna call for backup!</b>

06:55.830 --> 06:57.180
<b>This is car 3055...</b>

07:04.290 --> 07:05.550
<b>Drive.</b>

07:06.340 --> 07:07.550
<b>Where are we going?</b>

07:08.090 --> 07:09.030
<b>Where do you think?</b>

07:09.630 --> 07:11.050
<b>The police station.</b>

07:15.810 --> 07:16.850
<b>Say...</b>

07:16.850 --> 07:19.040
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

07:20.100 --> 07:22.900
<b>And those guys from before...</b>

07:22.900 --> 07:24.820
<b>how does a person
just burn up like that?</b>

07:24.820 --> 07:26.820
<b>He wasn't a person.</b>

07:26.820 --> 07:29.050
<b>He was one of them.</b>

07:29.050 --> 07:30.020
<b>Them?</b>

07:30.990 --> 07:33.450
<b>I'm sorry,
but I don't quite follow.</b>

07:35.780 --> 07:38.250
<b>What are you gonna do
at the station?</b>

07:39.000 --> 07:41.750
<b>I don't suppose you're
gonna turn yourself in?</b>

07:42.250 --> 07:46.750
<b>I've got questions about these disappearances,
so I'm gonna ask someone involved.</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:48.630
<b>Someone involved?</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:50.130
<b>What do you mean?</b>

07:51.470 --> 07:52.840
<b>You'll see.</b>

08:02.270 --> 08:03.830
<b>Is the chief around?</b>

08:04.270 --> 08:07.650
<b>Uh, yes, he's in his office.</b>

08:07.650 --> 08:08.320
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:15.570 --> 08:17.450
<b>What's this fuss about?</b>

08:17.450 --> 08:18.790
<b>It's him.</b>

08:18.790 --> 08:20.620
<b>Blade is here!</b>

08:21.500 --> 08:22.620
<b>Blade?</b>

08:22.620 --> 08:23.750
<b>He's coming!</b>

08:27.960 --> 08:29.130
<b>Excuse us.</b>

08:33.430 --> 08:34.550
<b>You!</b>

08:41.520 --> 08:43.020
<b>Take a look at this tattoo.</b>

08:44.810 --> 08:47.900
<b>It's proof that they work for Existence.</b>

08:48.770 --> 08:53.110
<b>They sold other humans out and sabotaged
your investigation, for their master's sake.</b>

08:54.240 --> 08:55.530
<b>Is that true, Captain!?</b>

08:56.280 --> 08:59.330
<b>Is that how you were always
at the scene before me!?</b>

08:59.330 --> 09:00.540
<b>Let me go!</b>

09:00.540 --> 09:02.850
<b>I was only doing what
the Chief asked me to!</b>

09:03.910 --> 09:05.870
<b>I can't believe this.</b>

09:05.870 --> 09:09.590
<b>I thought we were all
supposed to be cops!</b>

09:15.090 --> 09:17.760
<b>Tell me everything you know.</b>

09:21.640 --> 09:23.600
<b>The roots go deep, you know.</b>

09:24.480 --> 09:29.110
<b>We're everywhere and
we all work for Existence.</b>

09:29.570 --> 09:32.690
<b>The yakuza, the police,
and even the government.</b>

09:33.320 --> 09:37.030
<b>We're all working
to co-exist with them.</b>

09:37.780 --> 09:40.370
<b>And there's no way you can
disrupt that relationship.</b>

09:40.740 --> 09:44.040
<b>Even with your so-called power.</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:47.960
<b>They all think that the vampires
are gonna win some day,</b>

09:47.960 --> 09:50.960
<b>and that they can gain their favor
by sucking up to them.</b>

09:51.710 --> 09:54.260
<b>They give so much up,
all without <i>any</i> guarantees...</b>

09:56.300 --> 09:57.930
<b>Relationship?</b>

09:57.930 --> 09:59.910
<b>What relationship?</b>

10:00.390 --> 10:02.680
<b>You're in league with
yakuza and monsters!</b>

10:03.720 --> 10:05.930
<b>Tell me where those girls
were taken!</b>

10:07.270 --> 10:08.770
<b>They were taken as sacrifices.</b>

10:08.940 --> 10:09.900
<b>What!?</b>

10:09.900 --> 10:15.400
<b>It'd be a bargain to keep Japan safe by getting
rid of a couple of foreign whores...</b>

10:17.360 --> 10:20.160
<b>Where are they, you piece of shit!?</b>

10:28.670 --> 10:30.920
<b>You gonna be okay?</b>

10:31.540 --> 10:33.340
<b>I've got body armor on.</b>

10:33.340 --> 10:36.510
<b>And silver bullets don't hurt me.</b>

10:36.970 --> 10:37.800
<b>Silver!?</b>

10:38.840 --> 10:40.840
<b>Seriously, who the hell are you!?</b>

10:47.680 --> 10:48.770
<b>Well, whatever.</b>

10:48.770 --> 10:51.020
<b>Still, I can't believe this.</b>

10:51.020 --> 10:52.690
<b>I never would have guessed!</b>

10:55.030 --> 10:57.240
<b>You know everything now.</b>

10:58.280 --> 10:59.950
<b>The important part is what happens next.</b>

11:04.830 --> 11:06.560
<b>You've got family, right?</b>

11:07.250 --> 11:08.210
<b>Go home.</b>

11:08.580 --> 11:13.670
<b>I'd love to, but that'd be a waste of
the silver bullets I took off the captain.</b>

11:13.670 --> 11:16.090
<b>I'm gonna see this through to the end.</b>

11:36.980 --> 11:38.320
<b>That's weird.</b>

11:38.320 --> 11:39.190
<b>What?</b>

11:40.780 --> 11:45.080
<b>We're this far underground,
but there are no rats.</b>

11:45.330 --> 11:47.830
<b>You can see when it's this dark?</b>

11:58.340 --> 11:59.010
<b>Look.</b>

12:01.840 --> 12:03.430
<b>What's that?</b>

12:04.550 --> 12:07.430
<b>You see this a lot,
when you find one of their lairs.</b>

12:08.060 --> 12:08.970
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

12:13.900 --> 12:14.690
<b>Who are you!?</b>

12:14.940 --> 12:18.860
<b>My name is Tanaka,
and I'm in charge here.</b>

12:23.320 --> 12:24.910
<b>I've been waiting for you.</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:27.240
<b>This will be a good chance
for formal introductions.</b>

12:27.240 --> 12:31.430
<b>Welcome to one of
Existence's human farms.</b>

12:31.710 --> 12:33.210
<b>Human farms?</b>

12:33.620 --> 12:39.710
<b>They're our food,
and our organization's assets.</b>

12:40.050 --> 12:46.720
<b>We've gathered them here, into our custody,
to harvest their blood.</b>

12:50.770 --> 12:52.230
<b>What have you done?</b>

12:53.440 --> 12:57.650
<b>Don't worry, they're alive.</b>

12:57.650 --> 13:00.530
<b>Can't harvest anything
from a corpse, you know.</b>

13:00.530 --> 13:02.490
<b>They're valuable merchandise.</b>

13:03.450 --> 13:04.650
<b>You make me sick!</b>

13:05.280 --> 13:07.160
<b>Where's Deacon Frost!?</b>

13:07.160 --> 13:10.290
<b>He's already left the country...</b>

13:10.290 --> 13:12.660
<b>and I'll leave it at that.</b>

13:12.660 --> 13:16.170
<b>Because you're not
leaving Japan alive.</b>

13:26.640 --> 13:27.550
<b>What are these!?</b>

13:27.550 --> 13:28.720
<b>Monster cats!?</b>

13:32.720 --> 13:35.600
<b>First, let's take a look at your skills.</b>

13:38.560 --> 13:39.480
<b>Get down.</b>

13:48.160 --> 13:49.410
<b>Well done!</b>

13:50.870 --> 13:51.790
<b>Here I go!</b>

13:52.330 --> 13:53.660
<b>Take care of the girls!</b>

13:57.460 --> 13:59.330
<b>Hang on, I'll save you!</b>

14:34.290 --> 14:35.080
<b>It's okay.</b>

14:35.080 --> 14:36.580
<b>Don't worry.</b>

14:45.050 --> 14:46.090
<b>Goddammit.</b>

14:52.470 --> 14:54.810
<b>I've been waiting for this.</b>

14:55.680 --> 15:00.150
<b>You see, there is a breed of Japanese
vampire known as "Suikou."</b>

15:01.150 --> 15:02.690
<b>Are you familiar with the term?</b>

15:03.230 --> 15:06.190
<b>I happen to be one of them.</b>

15:35.760 --> 15:40.440
<b>I am invincible underwater,
while you are powerless!</b>

15:41.060 --> 15:43.480
<b>Do you understand?</b>

15:50.530 --> 15:51.280
<b>Shit!</b>

16:00.080 --> 16:00.660
<b>Shit!</b>

16:19.270 --> 16:20.270
<b>Who're you!?</b>

16:22.600 --> 16:23.980
<b>It doesn't matter.</b>

16:23.980 --> 16:26.820
<b>We need to save
the rest of these girls, now.</b>

16:33.740 --> 16:36.530
<b>You've served your purpose.</b>

16:36.530 --> 16:39.580
<b>It's time you met your death,
at my hand!</b>

16:45.880 --> 16:49.840
<b>Oh my, I see you're
still quite lively.</b>

16:49.840 --> 16:52.130
<b>This should be delightful!</b>

17:23.580 --> 17:27.130
<b>I suppose I've played
with him long enough.</b>

17:56.700 --> 18:01.700
THE FIRST
BLADE

17:57.450 --> 18:01.700
SAVAGE
MOON

18:13.000 --> 18:14.840
<b>I'm not going to die alone...</b>

18:19.090 --> 18:22.140
<b>Master Frost!</b>

18:26.430 --> 18:28.460
<b>I've finally found you, </b>

18:29.040 --> 18:30.110
<b>Blade.</b>

18:30.610 --> 18:31.980
<b>You need something?</b>

18:32.440 --> 18:34.730
<b>Oh yeah, something important.</b>

18:39.110 --> 18:39.610
<b>What was that!?</b>

18:42.830 --> 18:43.740
<b>This is bad!</b>

18:43.740 --> 18:44.330
<b>Get moving!</b>

18:53.800 --> 18:56.090
<b>Looks like I don't have time
to indulge you.</b>

18:57.670 --> 18:58.220
<b>Wait!</b>

19:18.650 --> 19:19.970
<b>It's a nice picture.</b>

19:20.820 --> 19:22.950
<b>Send it to your family,
they'll be glad to have it.</b>

19:23.950 --> 19:26.450
<b>Thank you, Officer Sakomizu.</b>

19:26.450 --> 19:29.620
<b>Nah, I didn't save you.</b>

19:30.710 --> 19:33.960
<b>If it wasn't for those two,
we wouldn't have made it out.</b>

19:34.920 --> 19:37.130
<b>Those were some strange Samaritans.</b>

19:40.970 --> 19:41.710
<b>Mizu!</b>

19:42.590 --> 19:44.260
<b>Sorry about the other night.</b>

19:44.720 --> 19:45.680
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

19:46.430 --> 19:50.350
<b>I just went through the ringer,
because I failed to get away in time.</b>

19:50.350 --> 19:51.690
<b>I guess so!</b>

19:55.730 --> 19:58.740
<b>So, just forget about what's happened.</b>

19:59.740 --> 20:02.490
<b>I'll talk to the higher ups,</b>

20:02.490 --> 20:07.540
<b>so just write the report up
as if this were an accident.</b>

20:09.120 --> 20:12.390
<b>Your daughter just had
her birthday, right?</b>

20:13.080 --> 20:16.920
<b>I sure hope she makes it
to next year.</b>

20:21.300 --> 20:24.890
<b>It's all over, okay?</b>

20:28.220 --> 20:30.600
<b>No, it's just beginning.</b>

20:35.940 --> 20:39.590
<b>It looks like I've got a lot
of work to do, you see.</b>

20:42.740 --> 20:44.840
<b>Now...</b>

20:46.700 --> 20:51.320
<b>I guess I'll go buy
a late birthday present.</b>

20:58.710 --> 21:02.670
Kobe

21:14.520 --> 21:17.190
<b>Where's Deacon Frost?</b>

21:21.110 --> 21:22.690
<b>The Philippines.</b>

23:01.460 --> 23:03.290
<b>Please, forgive me...</b>

23:03.290 --> 23:06.630
<b>I had to do it, to survive.</b>

23:08.550 --> 23:11.470
<b>You can be in sunlight,
and not burn up?</b>

23:11.470 --> 23:16.890
<b>You truly are the legendary Daywalker,
aren't you?</b>

23:19.100 --> 23:21.820
<b>I'll hunt them, as a man!</b>

23:22.610 --> 23:25.780
<b>And I'll kill the vampire
with four fangs!</b>

23:26.360 --> 23:29.820
<b>Next time on Blade: Vampire Hunter.</b>

23:26.360 --> 23:29.820
<i><b>Vampire Hunter</b></i>
